{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--direct-causation-unproductive-suffixes","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--debate"],"statement":{"en":"The unproductive causative suffixes -V, -ke, and -ka mark direct causation.","ja":"非生産的な使役接尾辞 -V、-ke、-ka は直接使役を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["-V","-ke","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0013-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:bugaevakobayashi2022@handbook-epub/l0102-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--unproductive-transitivizers-as-causatives","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--debate"],"statement":{"en":"The less productive transitive derivations in -V, -ke, and -ka may syntactically and functionally be analyzed as causatives.","ja":"非生産的な他動詞派生接尾辞 -V、-ke、-ka は、統語論および機能の観点から使役としても分析できる。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"tentative","conditions":[]},"forms":["-V","-ke","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0013-02","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--unproductive-transitivizers-as-causatives-southwest","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--debate"],"statement":{"en":"In Southwestern Hokkaido dialects, less productive transitive derivations in -V, -ke, and -ka can syntactically and functionally be regarded as causatives.","ja":"北海道南西部方言において、-V、-ke、-ka による非生産的な他動詞派生は統語的・機能的に使役とみなすことができる。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["-V","-ke","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0014-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--unproductive-transitivizers-as-causatives","differs_in":"scope","note":"Asserted specifically for Southwestern Hokkaido dialects as a refinement of the broader proposal for Ainu as a whole."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka-areal-frequency-northeast-sakhalin","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka"],"statement":{"en":"The transitivizing suffix -ka is more common in Northeastern Hokkaido dialects and Sakhalin Ainu than in Southwestern Hokkaido dialects.","ja":"他動詞化接尾辞 -ka は、北海道南西部方言に比べ、北海道北東部方言および樺太アイヌ語においてより一般的である。"},"type":"frequency","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest","doculect:hokkaido/northeast","doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"comparative","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka-sporadic-non-areal-distribution","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka"],"statement":{"en":"The causative suffix -ka attaches sporadically without clear semantic coherence and its distribution does not constitute an areal dialect feature.","ja":"使役接尾辞 -ka は互いに明確な意味的連関のない動詞に散発的に付加され、その分布は地域的方言特徴とは言えない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"some","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0199-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"contradicts","claim":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka-areal-frequency-northeast-sakhalin","differs_in":"unresolved","note":"Nakagawa rejects treating -ka as having a distinct regional dialect distribution, whereas Bugaeva identifies it as more frequent in Northeastern Hokkaido and Sakhalin."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-non-productive-causative-markers-v-ke-and","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--debate"],"statement":{"en":"The non-productive causative markers -V, -ke, and -ka all derive direct causative verbs and form a closed set of 158 items in the 387-verb sample: -V (111), -ka (38), and -ke (9).","ja":"非生産的な使役標識である-V、-ke、-kaは全て直接使役動詞を派生し、387動詞のサンプル中では-V（111個）、-ka（38個）、-ke（9個）という閉じたセットを成す。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-V","-ke","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0003-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-suffix-ke-is-employed-for-both-decreasing","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"The suffix -ke is employed for both decreasing and increasing valency.","ja":"接尾辞 -ke は結合価の減少と増加の双方に用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ke"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0022-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--non-productive-v-and-ka-derive-direct-causative","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"Non-productive -V and -ka derive direct causative verbs from non-action intransitive verbs and from bound verb roots, whereas -ke derives causatives exclusively from intransitive verbs.","ja":"非生産的な-Vと-kaは非動作自動詞および動詞語根から直接使役動詞を派生するのに対し、-keによる派生は全て自動詞からの派生である。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-V","-ka","-ke"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0003-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--in-derivations-from-intransitive-verbs-the-causative-suffix","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"In derivations from intransitive verbs, the causative suffix -V surfaces as -a, -i, -u, -e, or -o, whereas in derivations from bound roots it surfaces as -i, -u, -e, or -o, with -a not occurring.","ja":"自動詞からの派生では使役接尾辞-Vは-a/-i/-u/-e/-oのいずれかになるが、動詞語根からの派生例では-i/-u/-e/-oになり、-aは現れない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-V","-a","-i","-u","-e","-o"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0003-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-causative-suffixes-ka-and-ke-attach-only","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"The causative suffixes -ka and -ke attach only to stems consisting of two or more syllables.","ja":"使役接尾辞-kaと-keは、二つ以上の音節からなる語幹にしか付かない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ka","-ke"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0004-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--causativization-of-intransitives-with-ke-derives-verbs-from","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"Causativization of intransitives with -ke derives verbs from (a) state/process verbs, and (b) the singular forms of motion verbs ending in -n.","ja":"-keによる自動詞の使役化には、(a)状態／過程を表す動詞を語基とするものと、(b)-nで終わる移動動詞の単数形から派生されるものとがある。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ke","-n"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0004-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--there-are-no-examples-of-causative-derivation-from","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"There are no examples of causative derivation from transitive verbs using -ke.","ja":"-keによる他動詞からの使役派生の例は存在しない。"},"type":"absence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"none","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ke"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0005-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-choice-among-non-productive-causative-suffixes-v","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"The choice among non-productive causative suffixes -V, -ke, and -ka is largely determined according to the semantics of the base verb: -V attaches to process/state verbs and verb roots, -ka to spontaneous processes/actions or internal states/processes, and -ke to processes/states and verbs of motion.","ja":"非生産的な-V、-ke、-kaのいずれの使役接辞が付くかは動詞の意味に従って決まり、-Vは過程／状態動詞や動詞語幹に、-kaは自発的過程／動作や内的状態／過程動詞に、-keは過程／状態や移動動詞に用いられる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-V","-ke","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0011-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-only-adjunct-reducing-suffix-is-ke-which","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"The only adjunct-reducing suffix is -ke, which marks intransitivity on a small number of verbs expressing violent actions causing change.","ja":"項削減接尾辞は -ke のみであり、変化を引き起こす激しい動作を表す少数の動詞に付いて自動詞性を標示する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ke"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0182-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-intransitivizing-suffix-ke-attaches-to-vowel-final","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"The intransitivizing suffix -ke attaches to vowel-final verbs, dropping the stem-final vowel before -ke is added.","ja":"自動詞化接尾辞 -ke は母音末尾動詞に付加され、その際語幹末尾の母音は脱落する。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["with vowel-final verbs taking intransitivizing -ke"]},"forms":["-ke"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0182-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-transitivizing-allomorphs-ke-ka-and-a-copy","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"The transitivizing allomorphs -ke, -ka, and a copy vowel attach to intransitive verbs to form transitive verbs.","ja":"他動詞化異形態 -ke、-ka、および母音は、自動詞に付加されて他動詞を形成する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ke","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0182-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--some-morphological-causatives-have-a-weakened-sense-of","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--forming-suffixes"],"statement":{"en":"Some morphological causatives have a weakened sense of 'make do' and are better termed simply 'transitivization' (e.g. san 'go down from mountains to seashore' vs. san-ke 'bring out').","ja":"「〜させる」という意味が希薄で単に「他動詞化」と呼ぶ方がよいような場合もある（例：san「山から浜へ下がる」に対する san-ke「(手前に)出す」）。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["san","san-ke"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0254-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--in-southwestern-hokkaido-dialects-both-re-e-te","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka"],"statement":{"en":"In Southwestern Hokkaido dialects, both -re/-e/-te and -ka causative derivations are recorded for several intransitive verbs without any semantic difference.","ja":"北海道南西部方言においても幾つかの自動詞で、意味的な差のない-re/-e/-teと-kaの両方の派生形が記録されている。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-re","-e","-te","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2014@pdftotext-pieces/l0006-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-motion-verb-rikin-ascend-takes-ka-to","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka"],"statement":{"en":"The motion verb rikin 'ascend' takes -ka to form the causative rikin-ka 'raise' in many dialects.","ja":"移動動詞の中でも rikin「上がる」には多くの方言で -ka がついて使役形 rikin-ka「～を上げる」となる。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rikin","rikin-ka","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0199-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-causative-transitivizing-suffix-ka-is-attached-when","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka"],"statement":{"en":"The causative/transitivizing suffix -ka is attached when the stem ends in m or y (e.g. mom -> mom-ka, uhuy -> uhuy-ka), with exceptions ending in other sounds such as kotuk -> kotuk-ka, paraparak -> paraparak-ka, sések -> sések-ka, teyne -> teyne-ka.","ja":"使役/他動詞化接尾辞 -ka は語幹が m, y で終わる場合に付加される（例：mom → mom-ka、uhuy → uhuy-ka；例外：kotuk → kotuk-ka、paraparak → paraparak-ka、sések → sések-ka、teyne → teyne-ka）。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":["stem ends in m or y"]},"forms":["-ka","mom-ka","uhuy-ka","kotuk-ka","paraparak-ka","sések-ka","teyne-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0253-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--in-sakhalin-ainu-murasaki-1978-contrasts-the-transitive","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--ka"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, Murasaki (1978) contrasts the transitive form hosipi-ka 'to send back' with the causative form hosipi-re 'to have someone go home'.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、村崎 (1978) は他動詞形式 hosipi-ka「送り返す」と使役形式 hosipi-re「家に帰らせる」を対比させている。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["hosipi-ka","hosipi-re"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0033-07","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--the-transitivizing-suffix-kar-adds-an-object-to","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topics":["topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs","topic:valency/transitivizer-ka-valency-pairs--kar"],"statement":{"en":"The transitivizing suffix -kar adds an object to an intransitive verb, increasing its valency by +1.","ja":"他動詞を作る接尾辞 -kar は自動詞に目的語を加えて他動詞にするアリティ +1 の接尾辞である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["intransitive verb base"]},"forms":["-kar"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0205-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
